<title>USA: Alliance Bancorp sets quarterly payout.</title>
<headline>Alliance Bancorp sets quarterly payout.</headline>
<dateline>HINSDALE, Ill. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		$0.1625	     Not applicable</p>
<p> Pay		   June 30</p>
<p> Record		July 18</p>
<p>NOTE: Alliance and Liberty Federal Bank merged in February. Prior to the merger, Alliance paid a $0.10 a share quarterly dividend and Liberty paid $0.06.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
